<title>USA: U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. sorghum major sales activity in the week ended Oct 24 reported by exporters for the following purchasing countries, in tonnes:</p>
<p>Net Sales:   1996/97		  1997/98</p>
<p>Mexico	 54,000		    Nil</p>
<p>Net sales of 81,000 tonnes were more than four times the previous week and almost three times the four-week average.</p>
<p>Exports of 118,200 tonnes were 37 percent above the previous week and 14 percent over the four-week average.</p>
<p>Primary Export Destinations: Mexico (76,200) and Japan (42,000).</p>
</text>
